begincodeV2
name:Launcher'守方出生点放置
params:Long 出生点位置,Long type,Struct player,Float HPMul,Float crit,Float initHp
return:Bool ret
lines:
Float 地图宽度=act 1.this.Map'得到地图宽度()
Float temp0=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float -0.5)
Float temp1=fun float.division(var 地图宽度:Float 15)
Float temp2=varf Long.出生点位置.toFloat()
varf Float.temp2.addEqual(Float 0.5)
Float temp2=fun float.multiply(var temp2:var temp1)
Float x=fun float.add(var temp0:var temp2)
Float temp0=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float -1.5)
Vector3 relative=fun creatVariable.Vector3(var x:Float 0:var temp0)
varf Vector3.relative.setY(Float 5)
Vector3 position=fun vector3.add(var relative:var ScenarioOffset)
Bool ret=act 1.this.Launcher'AbstractSetBullet(var position:Vector3 0,0,1:var type:var Attr'Faction:var player:var HPMul:var crit:var initHp:Bool 0:Float 0)
endcode